---
const { companyOrigin = "", compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<footer class:list={{compact}}>
  <div class="top"><strong>마이너스베타스튜디오</strong><nav aria-label="하단 안내"><a href={`${companyOrigin}/`}>홈</a><a href={`${companyOrigin}/organization/`}>회사 정보</a><a href={`${companyOrigin}/#projects`}>프로젝트</a></nav></div>
  <details open={!compact}><summary>사업자 정보</summary><div class="business"><span>대표 강대종</span><span>호스팅 서비스 제공자 Cloudflare, Inc.</span><span>사업자등록번호 878-21-02478</span><span>통신판매업 신고 제2026-서울마포-1177호</span><span>주소 서울특별시 마포구 만리재로10길 4 (공덕동)</span><span>전화 <a href="tel:01074842927">010-7484-2927</a></span><span>이메일 <a href="mailto:minusbetastudio@gmail.com">minusbetastudio@gmail.com</a></span></div></details>
  <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} 마이너스베타스튜디오</p>
</footer>
<style>
/* 색은 공용 tokens.css. T-261024-050: 첫이름 trust-footer 와 같은 값(위 가는 줄·56px 위 간격·13/18 회색 글·링크 15/22 굵게 44px) — 숫자는 공용 톤 값만. */
footer{width:min(var(--page-max),calc(100% - var(--tone-gutter) * 2));margin:var(--tone-section-gap) auto 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:var(--tone-space-4) 0 var(--tone-section-gap);color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:var(--tone-caption-size);line-height:var(--tone-caption-line)}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:var(--tone-space-3);margin-bottom:var(--tone-space-3)}.top strong{color:var(--fg);font:var(--tone-weight-bold) var(--tone-label-size)/var(--tone-label-line) var(--tone-font)}nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--tone-space-1) var(--tone-space-3)}footer a{color:var(--fg);text-decoration:none}nav a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:var(--tone-tap-height);font:var(--tone-weight-bold) var(--tone-label-size)/var(--tone-label-line) var(--tone-font)}footer a:hover{color:var(--accent-hover)}a:focus-visible{outline:var(--tone-focus-width) solid var(--accent);outline-offset:var(--tone-focus-offset)}.business{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--tone-space-1) var(--tone-space-3)}.business span{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.business a{color:var(--fg-dim)}p{margin:var(--tone-space-3) 0 0;color:var(--fg-mute)}@media(max-width:650px){.top{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:var(--tone-space-1)}.business{display:grid}}
summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:var(--tone-tap-height);display:flex;align-items:center;color:var(--fg);font:var(--tone-weight-bold) var(--tone-label-size)/var(--tone-label-line) var(--tone-font)}summary::after{content:" +";margin-left:var(--tone-space-1)}.compact{color:var(--fg-dim)}.compact details .business{padding:var(--tone-space-1) 0}
</style>
